                            ADDITIONAL NOTICE
──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

Inko is a content reader framework. The core distribution does NOT include
any source extension by default. Source extensions are loaded dynamically
from the `server/extensions/` directory and are the sole responsibility of
the end user.

The author and contributors of Inko make NO claim about the legality or
appropriateness of any third-party extension, and disclaim all liability
related to the installation or use of such extensions.

Use of Inko and its extensions is intended for STRICTLY PERSONAL USE,
in jurisdictions where it is legal. Users must verify compliance with
copyright law in their own country before installing or using any source.
